WEBVTT

01:30.450 --> 01:34.920
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.270 --> 01:37.890
[Episode 23]

02:05.070 --> 02:06.400
Why are you hurt again?

02:10.870 --> 02:12.800
I just accidentally scratched it.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.400
Where did you get scratched?

02:18.320 --> 02:19.450
In the bamboo grove.

02:24.030 --> 02:25.910
You look very pale.

02:30.920 --> 02:32.110
I haven't been

02:32.480 --> 02:33.940
sleeping well these days.

02:39.150 --> 02:40.590
I just met Luoluo.

02:41.700 --> 02:42.960
He told me everything.

02:47.500 --> 02:48.130
Hmm.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.400
If there's nothing else,

02:53.710 --> 02:54.840
get some rest early.

03:03.150 --> 03:04.590
Don't you know your body

03:04.590 --> 03:07.280
can't take
being injured over and over again?

03:10.110 --> 03:11.000
I can handle it.

03:11.020 --> 03:12.740
Why must you be so stubborn?

03:13.360 --> 03:14.960
What choice do I have?

03:17.600 --> 03:18.780
As the Demon Lord,

03:19.960 --> 03:22.090
if I have no power to protect everyone,

03:22.870 --> 03:25.470
and I can't even fulfill
my responsibilities,

03:26.990 --> 03:28.990
I'm just a Demon Lord in name only.

03:31.950 --> 03:33.810
So you know you're the Demon Lord.

03:33.870 --> 03:34.870
Only with you around

03:34.870 --> 03:35.930
do the demons exist

03:36.450 --> 03:39.470
Small injuries accumulate and will
become serious problems.

03:39.470 --> 03:41.070
If something happens to you,

03:42.400 --> 03:43.800
what will happen to them?

03:45.210 --> 03:46.150
But I can't always

03:46.150 --> 03:47.630
let you risk yourself for me.

03:47.630 --> 03:49.470
Why can't we share the burden together?

03:49.470 --> 03:51.730
That would only make me feel more guilty.

03:52.750 --> 03:54.490
So I choose to do things my way.

03:57.560 --> 03:57.960
Fine.

03:58.430 --> 04:00.150
Do it your way then.

04:01.280 --> 04:01.910
I'm tired.

04:02.840 --> 04:03.640
You may leave.

05:22.190 --> 05:22.790
Xiao Ming.

05:22.800 --> 05:23.830
M-My Lord.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.260
Please don't be angry.

05:25.680 --> 05:27.560
I'm just really too tired.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.080
I haven't slept for days.

05:29.480 --> 05:32.060
Can we let Xiao Mu
come out to do the search?

05:32.510 --> 05:33.000
Sure.

05:37.360 --> 05:38.560
Rest up.

05:38.920 --> 05:39.780
I'll take over.

05:42.159 --> 05:43.460
My Lord, don't worry.

05:43.600 --> 05:45.530
We'll find a solution eventually.

05:49.240 --> 05:49.750
Xiao Mu.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.740
You've read so many books
and ancient texts,

05:53.920 --> 05:56.780
do you know any good methods
to relieve depression?

05:59.800 --> 06:00.310
But,

06:01.600 --> 06:03.000
depression is something

06:03.120 --> 06:04.870
only humans without power

06:04.870 --> 06:06.040
would have.

06:06.390 --> 06:08.450
Demons don't need to know about this.

06:10.920 --> 06:11.540
No, no.

06:11.750 --> 06:12.870
I mean,

06:13.000 --> 06:14.810
demons have better solutions.

06:14.990 --> 06:15.960
We can

06:15.990 --> 06:17.040
practice cultivation diligently,

06:17.040 --> 06:17.750
or

06:17.750 --> 06:18.480
go hunting,

06:18.750 --> 06:20.490
or take some magical medicine,

06:20.550 --> 06:21.680
or if all else fails,

06:21.720 --> 06:23.310
even having a fight
to let off steam works.

06:23.310 --> 06:23.830
Anyway,

06:23.830 --> 06:24.830
as long as we find

06:24.830 --> 06:26.240
the cause of the depression,

06:26.240 --> 06:27.160
that should solve it.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.160
What if it's just because

06:28.160 --> 06:30.620
you're trying too hard
to fulfill your duty,

06:30.830 --> 06:33.080
you end up hurting someone you love?

06:34.980 --> 06:36.120
Then it should be the other person

06:36.120 --> 06:37.580
who's feeling depressed.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.880
No, I misspoke.

06:40.900 --> 06:41.700
You're right.

06:41.870 --> 06:42.560
Go on.

06:44.000 --> 06:45.360
Then apologize to her,

06:45.360 --> 06:46.950
or just keep being good to her.

06:46.950 --> 06:48.800
Just make sure she knows how you feel.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.460
So how should I treat her well?

06:51.270 --> 06:53.270
I only know how to treat you well,
My Lord.

06:53.270 --> 06:54.240
As for others...

06:56.130 --> 06:57.659
It's pointless asking you.

06:59.260 --> 07:00.090
Xiao Ming.

07:00.480 --> 07:02.190
Before His Lordship recovers his power,

07:02.190 --> 07:03.390
when he wants someone to talk to,

07:03.390 --> 07:05.600
you should be the one to keep him company.

07:05.600 --> 07:07.060
Making His Lordship happy

07:07.430 --> 07:09.030
is harder than cultivation.

07:12.360 --> 07:14.120
Now you've got my attention.

07:15.730 --> 07:16.390
My Lord.

07:16.580 --> 07:17.590
Loving someone

07:17.950 --> 07:19.430
means sharing with her.

07:20.070 --> 07:21.560
No matter what happens,

07:21.560 --> 07:22.830
you have to bear it together,

07:22.830 --> 07:25.630
instead of enduring it alone.

07:28.620 --> 07:31.420
But what if I just
don't want her to share my burden?

07:33.870 --> 07:34.550
Love

07:34.850 --> 07:36.520
is supporting each other

07:36.720 --> 07:38.520
and sharing responsibilities.

07:38.680 --> 07:39.590
How do you know

07:39.630 --> 07:40.950
she would be upset

07:40.950 --> 07:42.360
if you share your burden?

07:42.510 --> 07:43.600
How do you know

07:43.600 --> 07:46.159
she wouldn't be upset

07:46.159 --> 07:47.960
if you decide to do things alone?

07:52.000 --> 07:53.390
Xiao Ming, where did you learn

07:53.390 --> 07:54.720
all this nonsense from?

07:56.750 --> 07:57.810
This is nothing.

07:57.950 --> 08:00.080
While looking through ancient texts,

08:00.100 --> 08:00.710
I happened

08:00.740 --> 08:02.480
to read a couple of plays
from the human realm

08:02.480 --> 08:03.880
and picked up a few lines.

08:04.940 --> 08:05.830
So you haven't

08:05.830 --> 08:07.310
been looking for a solution at all,

08:07.310 --> 08:08.840
but reading plays instead?

08:09.560 --> 08:11.090
Xiao Ming is right for that.

08:22.910 --> 08:23.920
Mr. Wu Huan,

08:23.980 --> 08:25.440
do you still hold a grudge?

08:25.750 --> 08:27.610
It's not your place to lecture me.

08:29.610 --> 08:30.760
Let's make a bet.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.679
Let's have a contest.

08:32.919 --> 08:34.419
If you win, I'll let you go.

08:34.840 --> 08:35.669
If you lose,

08:36.360 --> 08:37.960
you'll be at my mercy.

08:39.960 --> 08:41.289
Who do you think you are?

08:41.720 --> 08:42.520
What about it?

08:45.320 --> 08:45.790
Fine.

08:46.970 --> 08:47.900
Let's have a try.

09:36.910 --> 09:37.630
You lost.

09:38.470 --> 09:39.400
Your power

09:40.600 --> 09:42.000
has improved so quickly.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.640
Did you train so hard

09:44.720 --> 09:46.520
just to harm your own kind?

09:48.200 --> 09:50.050
Hong Ye became the Demon Lord

09:50.150 --> 09:52.150
because of his protection of demons

09:52.240 --> 09:53.820
and compassion for all beings.

09:53.820 --> 09:55.530
So even if he lost his power,

09:55.820 --> 09:58.080
he would still have everyone's support.

09:58.510 --> 10:00.510
Cultivation is also about the mind.

10:00.600 --> 10:02.800
I hope you let go of your obsession soon.

10:02.990 --> 10:04.460
Don't preach to me.

10:05.120 --> 10:07.780
Do what you want with me—
be it murder or torture.

10:12.400 --> 10:12.790
Hey!

10:28.390 --> 10:29.580
As the Demon Lord,

10:29.760 --> 10:31.360
I have my responsibilities.

10:32.080 --> 10:33.540
Though I've lost my power,

10:33.720 --> 10:36.170
no one knows
Demons' Valley better than I do.

10:36.170 --> 10:37.300
I don't want to hide.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.550
But I can't always let you

10:40.550 --> 10:41.750
risk yourself for me.

10:43.440 --> 10:45.700
That would only make me feel more guilty.

10:46.750 --> 10:48.410
So I choose to do things my way.

11:12.560 --> 11:14.710
Why is this only half written?

11:22.120 --> 11:22.670
Is there

11:23.150 --> 11:24.480
any clue in the book?

11:27.200 --> 11:29.000
Very few records talk about

11:29.000 --> 11:30.840
the Heart-Burning Incantation.

11:30.840 --> 11:32.710
I've only figured out that

11:32.910 --> 11:35.160
My Lord is unable
to use the power in his body

11:35.160 --> 11:37.540
because his heart meridian is damaged,

11:37.580 --> 11:38.910
but his power is still in there.

11:38.910 --> 11:39.520
Really?

11:39.960 --> 11:41.200
Of course.

11:41.200 --> 11:42.750
See for yourself if you don't believe me.

11:42.750 --> 11:45.480
Most of these ancient demon texts
are fragments—

11:45.510 --> 11:47.060
disconnected and incoherent.

11:47.060 --> 11:48.510
I've been piecing them together for days.

11:48.510 --> 11:50.120
I don't even know
if I can piece them together.

11:50.120 --> 11:50.750
You can.

11:50.750 --> 11:52.410
I'm sure you'll figure it out.

11:54.480 --> 11:55.870
Have you seen Hong Ye?

11:57.080 --> 11:58.670
Stop asking me questions.

11:58.670 --> 12:00.720
My head is already a mess.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.790
Okay. I'll leave you alone.

12:02.790 --> 12:03.720
You keep working on it.

12:03.720 --> 12:05.750
You're smart enough to figure it out.

12:05.750 --> 12:06.200
I...

12:07.910 --> 12:08.970
Why don't you do it?

12:26.200 --> 12:27.000
Don't run away.

12:27.000 --> 12:28.260
You're not getting it!

12:30.510 --> 12:31.960
Where did he go?

12:32.430 --> 12:34.090
Disappearing all over again.

12:37.150 --> 12:39.060
I told you that you can't do it.

12:54.200 --> 12:54.870
Xiao Yao.

13:32.000 --> 13:33.000
I think

13:33.720 --> 13:34.480
my wound

13:35.080 --> 13:36.210
needs new dressing.

13:36.480 --> 13:37.200
The medicine is inside the room.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.000
You know that.

13:38.440 --> 13:39.700
Go change it yourself.

13:47.440 --> 13:48.530
I was wrong

13:49.000 --> 13:49.850
last night.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.960
I made you worry.

13:53.800 --> 13:54.630
I know.

13:55.750 --> 13:57.150
Since I lost my power,

13:57.870 --> 13:59.800
I've been suppressing my anxiety.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.300
I always wanted to do something

14:03.030 --> 14:05.160
but feared you'd bear too much burden.

14:05.860 --> 14:07.010
For a hundred years,

14:07.840 --> 14:09.840
I've shouldered many things alone.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.240
I got used to it.

14:12.830 --> 14:14.630
I wanted so badly to protect you,

14:15.230 --> 14:16.830
yet feared you getting hurt.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.920
So I chose the stupidest way.

14:29.550 --> 14:31.150
Are you not saying anything?

14:32.240 --> 14:33.590
Not even a sentence?

14:35.270 --> 14:36.530
Please say something.

14:39.080 --> 14:40.840
Your wounds hurt me too!

14:40.840 --> 14:41.990
Don't you know that?

14:42.440 --> 14:43.790
Put yourself in my shoes.

14:43.790 --> 14:44.670
If I were the one getting hurt—

14:44.670 --> 14:45.550
always getting hurt—

14:45.550 --> 14:46.700
how would you feel?

14:48.120 --> 14:48.550
I...

14:55.550 --> 14:56.550
Don't be angry anymore.

14:56.550 --> 14:57.630
I am angry.

15:01.840 --> 15:02.970
Are you still angry?

15:06.720 --> 15:07.390
All right.

15:08.040 --> 15:09.190
It's my fault.

15:09.670 --> 15:10.480
I promise you.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.110
From now on,

15:12.510 --> 15:13.460
I will share

15:13.670 --> 15:15.110
everything with you,

15:15.600 --> 15:16.150
okay?

15:19.270 --> 15:20.270
In the future too.

15:24.960 --> 15:25.550
Forever.

15:39.530 --> 15:42.360
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

15:43.880 --> 15:46.610
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

15:46.270 --> 15:48.190
I know you are responsible.

15:48.100 --> 15:50.980
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

15:48.600 --> 15:50.130
But I want you to remember

15:50.440 --> 15:51.600
you are not alone.

15:52.170 --> 15:54.730
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

15:53.310 --> 15:54.490
If one day,

15:55.000 --> 15:56.060
the sky collapses,

15:56.190 --> 15:57.410
and you can't hold it up,

15:56.640 --> 15:59.550
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

15:58.150 --> 15:58.870
I will.

16:00.470 --> 16:01.900
If I can't hold it up,

16:00.950 --> 16:03.750
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

16:02.480 --> 16:02.870
then I—

16:02.870 --> 16:03.730
With me around,

16:04.320 --> 16:05.310
that day will never come.

16:05.180 --> 16:08.000
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

16:09.360 --> 16:12.060
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

16:10.400 --> 16:11.060
Hong Ye!

16:12.630 --> 16:13.390
Hong Ye!

16:14.440 --> 16:15.030
Xiao Yao!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.700
Put me down.

16:15.700 --> 16:18.860
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

16:17.150 --> 16:17.720
Xiao Yao!

16:20.090 --> 16:23.120
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

16:24.530 --> 16:27.530
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

16:28.730 --> 16:31.700
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

16:37.960 --> 16:39.000
A meteor shower.

16:39.830 --> 16:41.490
It's my first time seeing one.

16:45.240 --> 16:47.640
The stars in the sky
have fallen into chaos.

16:48.880 --> 16:49.640
The world...

16:50.950 --> 16:52.770
may face a great catastrophe.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.360
What catastrophe?

17:11.640 --> 17:13.510
The Revelation Star has shifted position.

17:11.920 --> 17:14.599
[Chanxin Temple]

17:16.579 --> 17:18.510
This is a sign of great calamity.

17:20.140 --> 17:21.420
[Chanxin Temple]

17:20.790 --> 17:22.920
The demons inside are extraordinary.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.030
Everyone must be careful.

17:24.030 --> 17:24.599
Yes.

19:26.510 --> 19:28.090
[Be Calm]

19:29.100 --> 19:29.940
[Be Calm]

19:49.760 --> 19:51.800
[Be Calm]

19:52.980 --> 19:53.600
Go after him!

19:53.100 --> 19:54.210
[Be Calm]

19:53.920 --> 19:54.350
Yes!

20:31.440 --> 20:32.730
You're also a demon.

20:32.900 --> 20:34.430
Why are you helping humans?

21:20.200 --> 21:21.860
This demon must have run too fast

21:21.860 --> 21:23.120
and had a heart attack.

21:23.750 --> 21:25.400
Things have been strange lately.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.770
Great demons that are usually troublesome

21:26.770 --> 21:28.610
keep suddenly collapsing on their own.

21:28.610 --> 21:29.590
Whatever the reason,

21:29.590 --> 21:30.190
it saves us

21:30.270 --> 21:31.200
a lot of effort.

22:01.510 --> 22:02.640
Greetings, My Lord.

22:09.500 --> 22:11.150
It's quite a large one this time.

22:11.150 --> 22:12.470
What's inside?

22:12.640 --> 22:14.770
A thousand-year-old mountain demon.

22:18.220 --> 22:19.180
Take it away.

22:23.110 --> 22:24.960
My Lord, you must be tired.

22:25.480 --> 22:28.680
They've been demanding
more and more live demons lately.

22:28.880 --> 22:31.810
There are no more great demons
left near the capital.

22:32.640 --> 22:34.680
Since His Majesty
can't drink from the Yuli Spring,

22:34.680 --> 22:36.510
he can only use these live demons
to make elixirs

22:36.510 --> 22:37.640
to prolong his life.

22:37.830 --> 22:40.270
I'm merely following orders.

22:40.420 --> 22:41.560
Only you

22:41.720 --> 22:43.800
can speak directly with His Majesty.

22:46.790 --> 22:48.450
His Majesty's verbal decree:

22:50.640 --> 22:52.160
the Bulwark Duke is ordered

22:52.160 --> 22:55.070
to report directly to the West Garden.

22:55.510 --> 22:56.440
I, Bingzhu,

22:57.110 --> 22:58.170
accept the decree.

23:05.030 --> 23:06.550
Your subject
pays respects to Your Majesty.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.360
Rise.

23:08.750 --> 23:10.750
Have you seen the Exalted Immortal?

23:10.880 --> 23:12.000
Did she say

23:12.000 --> 23:14.700
how I could obtain the Yuli Spring?

23:15.350 --> 23:16.150
Your Majesty,

23:16.230 --> 23:16.790
she—

23:17.510 --> 23:18.770
The Exalted Immortal,

23:19.070 --> 23:20.400
hasn't revealed that yet.

23:20.400 --> 23:21.070
When?

23:21.960 --> 23:22.830
You saw her?

23:23.790 --> 23:25.190
Just a glimpse from afar.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.750
What did the Exalted Immortal

23:28.750 --> 23:30.070
say?

23:32.470 --> 23:33.540
The immortal said

23:36.140 --> 23:38.200
Your Majesty need not worry too much.

23:41.640 --> 23:42.830
Until I obtain the Yuli Spring,

23:42.830 --> 23:45.590
I cannot find peace for a single day.

23:46.680 --> 23:48.440
What exactly
does Exalted Immortal want me to do

23:48.440 --> 23:52.300
to prove my sincerity?

24:08.920 --> 24:09.440
My Lord.

24:12.240 --> 24:13.790
The Elixir Refining Chamber
just reported that

24:13.790 --> 24:14.550
today's ingredient

24:14.550 --> 24:16.030
is barely usable.

24:18.130 --> 24:20.200
The Chamber's requirements
are getting higher.

24:20.200 --> 24:21.160
Ordinary demons

24:21.160 --> 24:23.890
can no longer
meet their needs for elixir making.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.610
However, I've received news that

24:25.610 --> 24:26.370
Hong Ye

24:26.400 --> 24:27.810
has returned to Demons' Valley

24:27.810 --> 24:29.210
and is greatly weakened.

24:29.260 --> 24:31.320
It's the perfect time to capture him.

24:31.950 --> 24:33.350
Congratulations, My Lord.

24:33.350 --> 24:35.230
It'll be
another great achievement for you.

24:35.230 --> 24:36.690
I've faced Hong Ye before.

24:37.740 --> 24:40.140
You've also been
to Demons' Valley with me.

24:40.270 --> 24:41.730
Do you think numbers alone

24:42.590 --> 24:44.250
would be enough to defeat him?

24:45.090 --> 24:46.490
I was merely suggesting.

24:46.750 --> 24:47.400
The final decision

24:47.400 --> 24:49.330
is of course yours to make,
My Lord.

24:54.670 --> 24:56.610
[Residence of the Bulwark Duke]

24:58.200 --> 24:58.720
Head back.

24:58.720 --> 24:59.160
Yes.

25:03.720 --> 25:07.910
[Residence of the Bulwark Duke]

25:13.280 --> 25:17.840
[Residence of the Bulwark Duke]

25:44.000 --> 25:45.710
That mountain demon was fierce.

25:45.710 --> 25:47.170
If you hadn't intervened,

25:47.750 --> 25:50.400
the Feiyu Guard
would have suffered heavy losses.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.030
Thank you.

25:52.030 --> 25:53.240
Help me brush my hair.

25:56.270 --> 25:56.870
Of course.

26:06.160 --> 26:07.760
Do you see any white strands?

26:07.850 --> 26:08.560
None at all.

26:13.830 --> 26:14.830
As a spirit,

26:15.920 --> 26:17.520
if I don't take human hearts,

26:18.240 --> 26:19.790
I consume my own essence.

26:22.510 --> 26:24.510
When did you learn to lie?

26:34.360 --> 26:35.830
All the great demons

26:36.350 --> 26:39.510
within close proximity
to the capital have been captured.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.720
Next time,

26:40.890 --> 26:43.950
let's go to Mount Qingqiu
to catch the nine-tailed fox.

26:51.510 --> 26:53.110
Capturing demons is my duty.

26:54.370 --> 26:55.770
You don't need to do this.

26:56.920 --> 26:59.590
Does Master Bingzhu think
I've done something wrong?

26:59.590 --> 27:01.510
What's yours is mine,
isn't it?

27:16.500 --> 27:18.390
You're speaking less and less.

27:21.280 --> 27:24.280
Are you putting your defenses up
now that I'm a spirit?

27:26.880 --> 27:27.400
No.

27:32.270 --> 27:35.110
I didn't understand
what Immortal Lord felt before.

27:35.110 --> 27:37.370
But now I am starting to understand more.

27:39.410 --> 27:41.740
Not getting love from the one you cherish,

27:42.400 --> 27:44.130
even if you take your heart out,

27:45.600 --> 27:47.730
the pain is still unbearable.

27:49.720 --> 27:52.320
You can only fill the void
with others' hearts.

27:58.310 --> 28:00.310
Now I also need human hearts.

28:04.030 --> 28:06.240
Many, many hearts.

28:15.880 --> 28:16.480
It's okay.

28:17.640 --> 28:18.240
It's okay.

28:20.000 --> 28:20.800
That's not it.

28:25.690 --> 28:27.340
That's not what I think.

28:29.480 --> 28:30.990
I just wanted to help you.

28:37.940 --> 28:39.730
I failed to take care of you.

28:44.640 --> 28:47.070
But I'm not who I used to be anymore.

28:48.890 --> 28:51.540
I really don't want you
to see me like this.

28:56.410 --> 28:58.030
While I still have my sanity,

28:58.480 --> 29:00.610
please, you and Tan'er end this for me.

29:06.590 --> 29:08.870
I only want you to remember Lu Pianpian,

29:09.760 --> 29:12.160
not some heartless, cold-blooded spirit.

29:18.070 --> 29:19.040
Please.

29:53.470 --> 29:55.600
Why haven't you gone after Hong Ye yet?

29:56.160 --> 29:57.110
You startled me!

29:59.170 --> 30:00.410
This is the capital.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.270
You're too bold!

30:01.270 --> 30:02.630
I've waited too long!

30:03.480 --> 30:03.920
His Maj—

30:03.920 --> 30:05.360
It's midnight,

30:05.400 --> 30:07.530
protect your family.

30:14.880 --> 30:16.880
His Majesty wants to attack Hong Ye,

30:17.160 --> 30:19.030
but Bingzhu refuses to deploy troops.

30:19.030 --> 30:20.880
Humans and demons are different.

30:20.880 --> 30:21.960
Court politics

30:21.960 --> 30:23.000
are incredibly complex.

30:23.000 --> 30:25.270
-I need to do it from various—
-Cut the crap.

30:25.270 --> 30:26.550
Isn't the Emperor supreme among humans?

30:26.550 --> 30:27.070
Tell him

30:27.070 --> 30:27.930
to send troops!

30:27.960 --> 30:28.640
If only!

30:29.640 --> 30:32.350
If only the Emperor listens to me,
things would be easier.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.350
I'm trying to find a solution.

30:33.350 --> 30:34.290
I'm thinking!

30:34.310 --> 30:35.070
Then think faster.

30:35.070 --> 30:35.870
I'm thinking!

30:43.350 --> 30:44.680
Have you figured it out?

30:45.000 --> 30:45.660
Yes, I have.

30:46.310 --> 30:47.170
That was quick.

30:47.440 --> 30:48.350
Why don't you talk
to the Emperor yourself?

30:48.350 --> 30:48.920
Get lost.

30:49.680 --> 30:50.510
Don't go.

30:50.510 --> 30:51.680
You're sending me to my death.

30:51.680 --> 30:52.920
Let me finish.

30:54.920 --> 30:57.170
His Majesty only wants the Yuli Spring.

30:57.310 --> 30:59.150
He doesn't care how we get it,

30:59.400 --> 30:59.830
right?

31:00.720 --> 31:03.000
Since Bingzhu can't fulfill
His Majesty's wishes,

31:03.000 --> 31:04.510
His Majesty is growing impatient.

31:04.510 --> 31:06.250
What does this have to do with me?

31:06.250 --> 31:07.680
If you and I

31:07.680 --> 31:09.160
can convince the Emperor

31:09.750 --> 31:12.080
to recognize you as the only Demon King...

31:12.710 --> 31:13.570
The Demon King.

31:15.640 --> 31:16.460
Go on.

31:17.000 --> 31:19.460
This way,
humans and demons can join forces.

31:19.570 --> 31:21.500
Whether it's eliminating enemies

31:22.160 --> 31:23.720
or obtaining the Yuli Spring,

31:23.720 --> 31:25.780
wouldn't everything become easier?

31:28.550 --> 31:31.070
Humans and demons
have fought for thousands of years.

31:31.070 --> 31:32.470
Would the Emperor agree?

31:33.390 --> 31:34.390
Right now,

31:34.750 --> 31:35.720
eliminating Hong Ye

31:35.720 --> 31:38.320
is the common goal
for both you and His Majesty.

31:46.790 --> 31:47.590
Let's go,

31:48.070 --> 31:49.160
my Demon King.

32:18.090 --> 32:20.290
Keep your head down. Don't look around.

33:07.550 --> 33:08.750
Where is the emperor?

33:08.930 --> 33:10.600
I'll go inform His Majesty right away.

33:10.600 --> 33:11.490
Lord Heiwu,

33:12.200 --> 33:13.580
please wait here

33:13.600 --> 33:14.800
and don't wander off.

33:46.030 --> 33:46.830
So luxurious.

33:47.750 --> 33:49.110
Way too luxurious.

33:56.550 --> 33:57.410
Ji Yan!

34:05.000 --> 34:06.160
Ji Yan!

34:07.920 --> 34:09.790
You lied to me!

34:20.630 --> 34:22.230
You lied to me!

34:34.170 --> 34:35.409
Lord Heiwu,

34:35.840 --> 34:36.940
I told you

34:36.969 --> 34:39.199
not to wander off.

34:39.280 --> 34:40.400
I'll kill you!

34:47.449 --> 34:48.130
Look.

34:48.590 --> 34:50.449
This is what a great demon is like.

34:52.340 --> 34:53.889
When it burns, it's truly

34:54.719 --> 34:56.199
extraordinary.

35:00.460 --> 35:01.260
Keep burning.

35:04.630 --> 35:05.630
Look.

35:08.070 --> 35:10.070
If you don't save him now,
he'll die.

35:10.510 --> 35:12.040
Why should I care if he dies?

35:12.320 --> 35:13.800
He was going to send me to the Feiyu Guard

35:13.800 --> 35:14.840
to be used as a broom.

35:14.840 --> 35:15.900
I'm not saving him.

35:16.960 --> 35:18.920
He used to be our teacher.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.030
Just one.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.950
I want to kick him.

35:22.550 --> 35:23.080
Go ahead.

35:23.550 --> 35:24.030
After you kick him,

35:24.030 --> 35:24.800
give me one.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.480
I've noticed something about you.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.480
You're really...

35:28.960 --> 35:29.320
I...

35:29.320 --> 35:30.520
It fell off by itself.

35:30.630 --> 35:31.000
I...

35:31.760 --> 35:32.620
Just one, okay?

35:34.810 --> 35:35.740
You owe me a kick.

35:42.760 --> 35:43.440
He ate it.

35:44.590 --> 35:45.190
Xiao Yao.

35:45.630 --> 35:47.360
Why are you being so nice to him?

35:49.190 --> 35:51.050
This is called "taming the hawk."

35:51.800 --> 35:52.860
"Taming the hawk"?

36:05.480 --> 36:06.400
Why save me?

36:07.280 --> 36:08.710
Cultivation is difficult.

36:08.710 --> 36:10.370
It would be a waste to let it go.

36:11.810 --> 36:13.080
Even if you save me,

36:16.710 --> 36:18.000
no one will believe me.

36:18.960 --> 36:19.510
I will.

36:21.690 --> 36:24.310
You already knew Heiwu
wasn't a good master,

36:24.550 --> 36:27.280
yet after being captured,
you only wanted to die.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.140
Is it because of guilt?

36:33.000 --> 36:34.110
If you can feel guilt—

36:34.110 --> 36:36.840
so much so you want to make up for it
with your life,

36:37.590 --> 36:38.550
someone like you

36:39.280 --> 36:40.810
cannot be inherently evil.

36:42.230 --> 36:43.060
Besides,

36:43.230 --> 36:44.760
dying is the easiest thing.

36:45.030 --> 36:47.550
But once you're dead,
you can't change anything.

36:47.550 --> 36:49.180
People might even

36:49.280 --> 36:50.590
whip your corpse, dig up your grave,

36:50.590 --> 36:51.710
spit on your grave,

36:51.710 --> 36:53.280
and you won't be able to fight back.

36:53.280 --> 36:54.420
How frustrating would that be?

36:54.420 --> 36:54.880
Yeah.

36:55.150 --> 36:56.950
Can you stand such humiliation,

36:57.070 --> 36:57.840
Mr. Wu Huan?

37:04.230 --> 37:05.230
That makes sense.

37:08.760 --> 37:09.810
I found it!

37:10.070 --> 37:11.490
I found it!

37:11.670 --> 37:12.360
Xiao Yao!

37:12.510 --> 37:13.670
Quickly call My Lord back!

37:13.670 --> 37:15.680
My Lord, in this ancient demon record,

37:15.680 --> 37:19.080
there's information
about the Heart-Burning Incantation.

37:19.960 --> 37:20.710
The Heavenly Mother

37:20.710 --> 37:22.280
used the Heart-Burning Incantation,

37:22.280 --> 37:23.550
sealed her own power,

37:23.800 --> 37:25.930
and then disappeared without a trace.

37:26.920 --> 37:28.520
The stone she was standing on

37:28.630 --> 37:30.110
witnessed the scene

37:30.310 --> 37:32.310
and transformed into the Sky Stone.

37:32.400 --> 37:34.400
The last time the Sky Stone appeared

37:35.150 --> 37:36.350
was at the West Coast.

37:37.440 --> 37:38.610
The West Coast?

37:39.000 --> 37:40.030
What kind of place is that?

37:40.030 --> 37:41.290
The West Coast

37:41.510 --> 37:43.410
is guarded by an ancient beast
called the Treasure Swallower.

37:43.410 --> 37:45.230
The Treasure Swallower
is greedy by nature.

37:45.230 --> 37:46.800
It collects treasures from the world

37:46.800 --> 37:48.220
and seals them in its treasury,

37:48.220 --> 37:49.710
allowing things in but never out.

37:49.710 --> 37:50.450
My Lord,

37:50.800 --> 37:51.840
there's no need to worry.

37:51.840 --> 37:52.700
I'll go for you.

37:53.280 --> 37:54.000
For my lord,

37:54.120 --> 37:55.400
I would die a thousand deaths.

37:55.400 --> 37:56.800
The Treasure Swallower is no small beast.

37:56.800 --> 37:59.000
Going there rashly
would be extremely dangerous.

37:59.000 --> 38:00.130
The journey is long,

38:00.280 --> 38:01.920
and you'll have
to cross the vast Western Sea.

38:01.920 --> 38:03.840
The Western Sea has storms year-round,

38:03.840 --> 38:05.110
with terrifying waves.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.040
In those waters,

38:06.150 --> 38:07.810
scaled dragons often appear.

38:07.960 --> 38:08.440
I...

38:08.880 --> 38:09.680
I got it.

38:10.320 --> 38:10.980
Wait for me.

38:23.850 --> 38:25.380
I've spoken with Wu Huan.

38:25.510 --> 38:27.840
He's willing
to carry us to the West Coast.

38:37.150 --> 38:38.680
My Lord, I don't believe it!

38:38.920 --> 38:40.280
I don't believe in just these few days,

38:40.280 --> 38:41.510
he has changed his nature.

38:41.510 --> 38:43.230
He must be looking for an excuse

38:43.230 --> 38:44.360
to escape when he gets the chance!

38:44.360 --> 38:45.160
I believe him.

38:46.030 --> 38:47.760
Wu Huan's true form is a falcon.

38:47.760 --> 38:48.650
Like an eagle,

38:48.880 --> 38:50.630
he is able to soar in the highest skies,

38:50.630 --> 38:51.890
with lofty ambitions.

38:52.400 --> 38:53.210
Before,

38:53.440 --> 38:55.170
he was just bewitched by Heiwu.

38:59.070 --> 38:59.760
My Lord...

39:02.110 --> 39:02.590
Wu Huan.

39:04.440 --> 39:06.840
Do you know
why I need to go to the West Coast?

39:11.190 --> 39:13.190
In my battle with the Dreamshard Immortal,

39:13.190 --> 39:14.230
I lost my power.

39:15.110 --> 39:16.670
This trip to the West Coast

39:17.190 --> 39:18.000
is to find

39:18.000 --> 39:20.000
the Sky Stone that will restore my power.

39:20.000 --> 39:20.630
My Lord,

39:20.920 --> 39:22.480
why are you telling him this?

39:22.480 --> 39:24.230
If I spend every day fearing betrayal

39:24.230 --> 39:25.120
and death,

39:25.590 --> 39:27.850
then I might as well
not be the Demon Lord.

39:28.000 --> 39:29.330
Since I have a weakness,

39:29.480 --> 39:30.740
rather than hiding it,

39:31.030 --> 39:32.550
it's better that everyone knows,

39:32.550 --> 39:33.810
so I can find other ways

39:33.880 --> 39:35.810
to fulfill my duties as Demon Lord.

39:35.920 --> 39:36.480
This way,

39:37.190 --> 39:38.650
it's no longer a weakness.

39:40.550 --> 39:41.030
Wu Huan,

39:42.400 --> 39:44.150
this journey is extremely dangerous,

39:44.150 --> 39:47.010
and whether I can
restore my power remains unknown.

39:47.230 --> 39:48.560
I'm telling you all this

39:48.960 --> 39:51.300
because I want to be an honest Demon Lord.

39:52.000 --> 39:53.200
The same goes for you.

39:53.800 --> 39:55.760
If you can face your past openly

39:56.360 --> 39:58.440
and let go
of the evil thoughts in your heart,

39:58.440 --> 39:59.550
you will still be

40:00.230 --> 40:01.960
a pure member of the demon race.

40:04.700 --> 40:05.830
I believe in you.

40:13.930 --> 40:15.730
Wu Huan pays respects to My Lord.

40:15.760 --> 40:17.890
I am willing to lay down my life for you,

40:19.110 --> 40:20.280
in life or death.

40:22.000 --> 40:22.590
My Lord,

40:23.360 --> 40:25.610
even if he's willing to sacrifice himself,

40:25.610 --> 40:26.940
with his level of power,

40:27.320 --> 40:29.510
if he meets the Treasure Swallower
at the West Coast,

40:29.510 --> 40:30.650
he'll die.

40:30.880 --> 40:32.550
-It doesn't matter.
-I'm worried.

40:32.550 --> 40:34.000
You stay in Demons' Valley.

40:34.000 --> 40:35.260
We'll go by ourselves.

40:35.630 --> 40:36.100
But...

40:36.440 --> 40:37.250
My Lord!

40:37.880 --> 40:39.210
What are you doing here?

40:40.760 --> 40:41.890
I heard everything.

40:42.670 --> 40:45.070
This time,
on my way back with His Lordship,

40:45.480 --> 40:46.920
though His Lordship was injured,

40:46.920 --> 40:48.520
he still saved me many times.

40:48.880 --> 40:50.610
I brought some food

40:50.670 --> 40:52.550
for Xiao Yao and His Lordship
on their journey.

40:52.550 --> 40:54.000
The West Coast is so far away.

40:54.000 --> 40:55.530
You'll definitely need it.

40:55.960 --> 40:56.590
Thank you.
